  "explainer": "Shadow energy price is the LP dual on the switchboard power-balance constraint: the marginal cost of one extra kWh of net energy at the meter for the current dispatch interval. Envelope shadow prices show where HAEO's forecast envelope is actually constraining flex, in dollar terms. Import side draws on the load forecast limit; export side draws on the solar forecast limit."
